---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/bubi.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A little about myself"
	pubDate={new Date('September 07 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hello! I'm Ellen, and my best friend is Squi, a little squirrel plushie 🐿️ (or racoon?). In real life, I'm actually a timid person. Squi is my favorite childhood plushie, and I love to use Squi to represent myself. I live in a Southeast Asia country, known for its beautiful forests🌲, beaches 🏖️, and volcanic mountains 🌋.  
	</p>

	<p>
		I write this blog to record my life journey: the thoughts, feelings, and little moments.

		I am also inspired to write blogs as I remembered, during university years, I often read blogs from senior competitive programmers and I felt very inspired by them, which left a big impact on my CP journey. I hope that through sharing my experiences in this blog, it can help someone out there, and can be a place where people find comfort.
	</p>
</Layout>
